              "creator": "ctanase@mozilla.com",
              "id": 17817711,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 146.0/148\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Go to https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/Tectonic_plates_boundaries_physical_World_map_Wt_180degE_centered-en.svg\n2. Zoom out or scroll the map.\n3. Observe the left and right side of the map.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nThe lines/continental boundaries are displayed.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nThe lines/continental boundaries are missing on the right and left side.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/196553",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 146.0/148\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Go to https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/Tectonic_plates_boundaries_physical_World_map_Wt_180degE_centered-en.svg\n2. Zoom out or scroll the map.\n3. Observe the left and right side of the map.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nThe lines/continental boundaries are displayed.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nThe lines/continental boundaries are missing on the right and left side.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/196553",
              "time": "2025-12-22T06:02:39Z"
